================| YGGDRASIL VALHALLA |=================

  -  Get/start docker container images
  -  Copy over data from old install
  -  Import ZFS pools and verify data, optionally scrub
  -  Setup secrets in /etc/nullmailer
  -  Enable nullmailer service
  -  Setup secrets in /etc/yggdrasil/zed.rc
  -  Enable zfs-zed service
  -  Enable zfs-scrub-monthly@data1 timer
  -  Enable zfs-scrub-monthly@data2 timer
  -  Enable zfs-scrub-monthly@data3 timer
  -  Enable btrfs-scrub-mail timer
  -  Edit /etc/samba/smb.conf
  -  Set smbpasswd -a <user>
  -  Enable smb service

